OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 16 APR
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,7,     Gfavourites from composers such as
OL,8,     GBruch, Elgar and Rachmaninov.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GThe BBC Symphony Orchestra
OL,11,     Gconducted by Sakari Oramo on tour
OL,12,     Gin China perform Brahms's
OL,13,     GSymphony No 2, Judith Weir, and
OL,14,     Gwith soloist Bertrand Chamayou
OL,15,     GBartok's Piano Concerto No 3.
OL,16,G2145FThe Essay: Martin Hayes Turns the
OL,17,     FTune
OL,18,     GIn conversation with Olivia
OL,19,     GO'Leary, traditional Irish
OL,20,     Gmusician Martin Hayes talks about
OL,21,     Ghis musical hero, the legendary
OL,22,     Gfiddle-player Tommie Potts.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
